# Mosquitto ACL for the external WebSocket listener (devices via the tunnel).
#
# `%u` is the connecting device's username. Each device may publish ONLY to a
# topic whose first segment equals its own username, so a compromised device
# cannot spoof another station's readings.
#
# Convention: name each device's MQTT login the SAME as its device identifier
# (the segment after "aquamind/"). e.g. login "UNIMAP01" -> may publish to
# aquamind/UNIMAP01 (and any subtopic under it). Subscribing is not granted.
pattern write aquamind/%u
pattern write aquamind/%u/#
